5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The room is a mess because nobody owns the cleanup. I need to see who actually uses it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,We are strangers despite working close. I want to know where our difficult talks go.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of hidden upkeep costs. I need to see the invoices for outside hire.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I refuse to sign for a room that fails us. I need the quotes for the fit-outs.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,The noise and crumbs are the real complaints. I’ll check the partition wall and the bins.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, invoices are good, but I need the tally of use to see the imbalance.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
