35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people used it eleven times, others four. The fridge clear-out was done twice by one person.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The last awkward talk was across desks, in front of everyone. Since the refit, unplanned talk only happens by the printer.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"We paid 68,000 yen for outside hire last year. The hot lunch round trip takes twenty-five minutes, three days a week.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The meeting space quote is 141,000 yen. The kitchen is 96,000. Facilities logged eleven callouts for equipment rooms.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The partition is single plasterboard; calls are audible. Three keyboards have crumbs, and bins go out daily.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, 141,000 is steep. But the tally proves the current ""first come"" system is broken.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, the awkward talk proves we need a private space. The printer corner is not enough.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, 96,000 for a kitchen? We already pay 68,000 for outside hire. That’s a bad trade.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the kitchen quote is lower, but the callouts show equipment rooms are high maintenance.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the plasterboard wall means a quiet room is impossible. Sound travels.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, if sound travels, a quiet room is a lie. We need a defined meeting space.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, agreed. A meeting space gives us a place to talk without an audience.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, I worry about the upkeep. Who cleans the meeting room? The tally shows it’s always the same people.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, fair point. But the kitchen quote is cheaper. However, the crumbs are a problem.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@May, the crumbs are a symptom. The real issue is the lack of a proper place to eat or talk.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I’m leaning towards the meeting space. It solves the awkward talk problem.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The meeting space is the only option that respects our need for privacy.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"I’m hesitant. The cost is high, and the upkeep is unclear. But the lunch trip is painful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"The numbers favor the kitchen, but the maintenance risk is high. I need to think.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,The sound issue kills the quiet room. It’s between kitchen and meeting space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
